%% Section 9, "When the best server is busy": the router overrides prefix
%% affinity (load_override) and the idle replica loads the prefix from Valkey.
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Chat client
  participant R as Router (Envoy + EPP)
  participant A as vllm-a
  participant B as vllm-b
  box rgb(220, 252, 231) KV cache
    participant L as LMCache server
    participant V as Valkey db 0 (KV chunks)
  end

  Note over A: holds the conversation's prefix
  R->>A: long job 1 (1,000 output tokens), sticky
  R->>A: long job 2 (1,000 output tokens), sticky
  Note over A: both slots busy, about 2,000 in-flight tokens
  Note over B: idle, 0 in-flight tokens
  C->>R: next turn of the conversation
  Note over R: A's estimated wait is too long: load_override
  R->>B: send the turn to vllm-b
  rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
    B->>L: load the prefix
    L->>V: read KV chunks
    V-->>L: most of the prefix
    L-->>B: KV for the prefix
  end
  Note over B: computes only the rest
  B-->>C: first token
